    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person driving adventure and scavenging survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden, mysterious blizzard, the world has fallen into ruin. You drive a heavily modified steam-powered truck, heading north\u2014toward the rumored origin of the catastrophe. The extreme cold is your greatest enemy, threatening not only your body but also your truck\u2019s boiler, water tank, and fragile pipes. Searching forests and ruins buried in snow for supplies is your only way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go? What secrets will you uncover? And can you ultimately learn the truth behind it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This steam truck is your only home in a frozen world:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/b93ef4d9c3bcbb48e2403fc388d970ab.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the boiler running with a constant supply of fuel:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/d59b56ee17c54d7f58a9b95c21ebe3c7.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade truck parts to boost performance:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/ef56ccab087ce4fa4520933894ee8dad.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a small shelter on the truck\u2019s rear platform:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/37cb94f275ea6699e71c7718275bd568.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, scavenge, cook, craft, and forge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/0b1d754c619154951fdc4f43146d5d70.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span><br>Create your own journey through a frozen wasteland.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first-person driving adventure and scavenging survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a sudden, mysterious blizzard, the world has fallen into ruin. You drive a heavily modified steam-powered truck, heading north\u2014toward the rumored origin of the catastrophe. The extreme cold is your greatest enemy, threatening not only your body but also your truck\u2019s boiler, water tank, and fragile pipes. Searching forests and ruins buried in snow for supplies is your only way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go? What secrets will you uncover? And can you ultimately learn the truth behind it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This steam truck is your only home in a frozen world:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/b93ef4d9c3bcbb48e2403fc388d970ab.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep the boiler running with a constant supply of fuel:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/d59b56ee17c54d7f58a9b95c21ebe3c7.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade truck parts to boost performance:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/ef56ccab087ce4fa4520933894ee8dad.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a small shelter on the truck\u2019s rear platform:<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/37cb94f275ea6699e71c7718275bd568.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, scavenge, cook, craft, and forge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728790/extras/0b1d754c619154951fdc4f43146d5d70.avif?t=1754538757\" width=620 height=300 /></span><br>Create your own journey through a frozen wasteland.</p>",
